### Paste text
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/text
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title":"Photosynthesis",
    "text":"Photosynthesis converts light energy into chemical energy in chloroplasts."
}

### Upload PDF
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/upload
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=X

--X
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test2.pdf
--X--

### List
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere

### Generate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes/60001/generate
Authorization: Bearer PasteTokenHere